---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="Cookie policy for DevToolkit.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: [add date when you publish]</em></p>
    <p>This site uses local storage (not traditional cookies) to remember your theme preference (light/dark mode) and, for BYOK tools, your own API key — stored only in your browser, never sent to us.</p>
    <p>If Google AdSense is enabled on this site, Google and its advertising partners may set cookies to serve relevant ads and measure ad performance. You can manage ad personalization via <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>
    <p>We do not use cookies for cross-site tracking of individual users beyond what's described above.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
